+    </div>
+    <p class="lead rv" data-d="4" style="margin-top:2rem">A new candidate arrived after the vote closed, so it gets the same treatment ICONIS got. A fair reading, the register, the domains, and no thumb on the scale. The idea is one move: an eight, turned a quarter on its side, is the infinity sign. The name states the category and then refuses its arithmetic.</p>
